# Transcripts are verbatim captures. Git must not touch a single byte of them.
#
# The repository sets `core.autocrlf = input`, which would strip the carriage
# returns esp-emu emits — and a "verbatim" capture that git edited on the way in
# is not a capture. The ANSI escapes, the espflash progress bars and the CRs are
# all part of the bytes under test.
*.txt -text
